---
<Layout title="Turnkey Garden Rooms: Everything Included | Luxury Modules" description="What turnkey actually means: groundworks, install, connections, finish and planning, all handled. Compare what is included module by module."  image="/images/og/turnkey.jpg" imageAlt="A finished stone-clad module with arched doors and a curved dark roof, lit from within, a couple sitting by a firepit on the deck" share="Turnkey means groundworks, install, connections, finishes and planning. The list of what is included is on this page." schema={schema}>
  <div class="pg-turnkey"><Fragment set:html={body} /></div>
